  "source_review": [
    "Complete fixed three-grant program read. All writes are exclusively the three literal Task/work grants, using wx/fsync/close/hash readback. No subprocess, HTTP, native harness, database, lock acquisition, cleanup, replacement or renewal is invoked.",
    "Actual current five core values, raw source/suite/build/candidate, direct binder preparation and review, retained family/top and direct three inner/two outer reviews are pinned. Runtime invocation still independently calls the current deep binder before grants.",
    "All outputs and all grants must be absent and shared lock free before writes and throughout final guards. One cryptographic64hex token is generated for Migration only. BODY retains its outer-generated token and EOF owns its own lock.",
    "BODY/Migration/EOF primary guards and Top field schemas compared against the emitted fields, output paths, deadlines and command arrays. Less-than-two-hour actual time window and direct user continuation reference retained.",
    "Partial filesystem failures are failures; already-created owned grants remain inspectable. No runtime success or inner/outer acceptance is supplied by issuing."
  ],
